# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-9, 2.1-21). As L5_10_parts_of_sort_load, the place read from a row, which load doesn't see:
# RUN-DOMAIN `of <q> at <x>, which keeps no labels of its sort` (L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
kind couples: parties
kind lots: place PLN min 0
  batched
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w order k.batch.day
input which: key places
place konto: lots lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input b1_day: date
input b1_amt: money PLN
move b1: transfers
  on b1_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount b1_amt
ask q: bal(which, 2026-03-31) of ania, bal(which, 2026-03-31) of b1

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1981-01-01..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2010-06-01..
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  b1_day = 2026-02-01
  b1_amt = 100.00 PLN
  which = konto
=== expect
q: (refused: RUN-DOMAIN of ania at konto, which keeps no labels of its sort, 100.00 PLN)
  cut 2026-01-01
